mic cabin layout, featuring:\n\nExecutive Class (Left side of image)\n2+1 configuration with ultra-wide 24\" seats\n\nFull flat-recline (110°–180°), segmented memory foam cushions\n\nMassage modules with 5 comfort programs\n\nFold-away 17\" 4K entertainment displays in brushed aluminum casing\n\nPrivacy side wings and ambient reading lights\n\nPremium Economy (Right side of image)\n2+2 layout, 20\" ergonomic seats with lumbar adjustment\n\nFold-out composite work tables with dual USB-C and AC charging ports\n\nRetractable footrests and coat hooks\n\nInterior Architecture\nModular overhead luggage bins (50L per seat), seamless design\n\nCeiling-integrated LED mood lighting with 3000K–6500K dynamic adjustment\n\nAcoustic composite side panels rated at 35dB sound absorption\n\nTextured flooring with tactile lines for directional guidance\n\nAccessibility Features\nDedicated wheelchair bay with electric securement clamps\n\nEmergency buttons and braille labeling at every row\n\nWider aisles for mobility aid access\n\nColor scheme: platinum body panels, navy-blue seating, brushed metal and genuine leather accents.\nDesign annotations: dimension labels, airflow arrows, lighting temperature indicators, and noise reduction zones.\nVisual style: functional yet elegant, emphasizing comfort, space efficiency, and inclusive design for high-speed rail travel.\n\n--v 6.1 --style raw --q 2 --s 25"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "JjkText", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [398.715087890625, 300.34967041015625], "pos": [302.5674743652344, -378.8779602050781], "id": 28, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "IMAGE", "links": [33], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"shape": 3, "name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [429.7706604003906, 679.181884765625], "pos": [288, -32], "widgets_values": ["9a72912ebaebb09e1168de7624e0a67f5c41fe3c46fc7da84c5